I have the new metro card in my hand.
I go to the entrance gate.
I tap the card there.
The gate opens.
I enter inside.
Then, I go up by the escalator.
I stand behind the yellow line.
The metro moves fast.
Soon, a new train arrives.
Its doors open.
First, people alight from the train.
Then, I board the metro train.
The train's carriage is cool.
There is air-conditioning here.
I see an empty seat.
I sit on the seat.
Now, my journey by metro train begins.
